    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i'm just so tired of not sleeping. if i take the wine and the ambien and i feel way too sleepy or something, i can just... i don't know, just stay in bed? i'm not driving or anything. i feel like you're being a bit dramatic about it. it's just a little bit of wine. if i keep it to just one glass and take my dose like usual, isn't it basically the same thing as just taking a slightly stronger dose of the medicine? it seems like it would just be a way to make it more effective for a one-time thing.",
